#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Nixarchy override: channels are flake inputs, not pacman repos.
# omarchy:summary=Explain how to switch nixpkgs channel via flake inputs.

cat >&2 <<EOF

Nixarchy uses flake inputs for channel selection, not pacman repos.

To switch nixpkgs channel, edit flake.nix's nixpkgs.url:

  github:nixos/nixpkgs/nixos-unstable   (edge / dev)
  github:nixos/nixpkgs/nixos-25.05      (stable)

Then update and rebuild:

  cd "\${NIXARCHY_FLAKE:-\$HOME/.config/nixarchy}"
  nix flake update nixpkgs
  sudo nixos-rebuild switch --flake .

EOF
exit 1
